WEBVTT

00:07:00.082 --> 00:07:03.043
I want to know if you
ever listened to The Beatles.”

00:07:03.502 --> 00:07:05.796
His two translators whisper in his ear.

00:07:06.172 --> 00:07:09.341
There's some confusing looks
amongst the entourage,

00:07:09.341 --> 00:07:11.051
and then his mood drops.

00:07:11.677 --> 00:07:14.346
And in Russian, he orders
the two translators

00:07:14.346 --> 00:07:18.392
and all his political advisers
out of the room, immediately.

00:07:19.226 --> 00:07:20.978
The bodyguards stay.

00:07:21.937 --> 00:07:23.981
And then Putin turns to me

00:07:23.981 --> 00:07:27.026
and in perfect English, he says,

00:07:27.067 --> 00:07:28.444
“I love The Beatles.”

00:07:28.486 --> 00:07:29.695
(Laughter)

00:07:29.737 --> 00:07:31.739
I said, "I didn't know you spoke English."